&lt;li&gt;docs: fix link reference for child Layout in documentation: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4568370465&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/94327&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vercel/next.js/pull/94327/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/pull/94327&quot;&gt;#94327&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
