    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/vercel/next.js/releases/tag/v16.5.0-canary.43"/>
    <title>v16.5.0-canary.43</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h3&gt;Core Changes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;fix(app-render): stop prerendered Link headers from accumulating on revalidation: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6120719431&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/100960&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vercel/next.js/pull/100960/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/pull/100960&quot;&gt;#100960&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align eslint-config-next TypeScript peer with typescript-eslint: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6230271916&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/101247&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vercel/next.js/pull/101247/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/pull/101247&quot;&gt;#101247&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reduce header allocations in NodeNextResponse: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6227050057&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/101225&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vercel/next.js/pull/101225/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/pull/101225&quot;&gt;#101225&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[image-optimizer] Move next/image-optimizer-transform under the next/experimental namespace: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6232177610&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/101252&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vercel/next.js/pull/101252/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/pull/101252&quot;&gt;#101252&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[image-optimizer] Don&#39;t use NextConfigComplete for the imageOptimizerTransform public API: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6217654957&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/101184&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vercel/next.js/pull/101184/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/pull/101184&quot;&gt;#101184&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve Request Insights context menus and trace interactions: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5235711915&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/97796&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vercel/next.js/pull/97796/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/pull/97796&quot;&gt;#97796&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and analyze in one pass: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5784780527&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/99962&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vercel/next.js/pull/99962/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/pull/99962&quot;&gt;#99962&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Misc Changes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;docs: clarify SVG handling in the Image Optimization API: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6249670105&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/101301&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vercel/next.js/pull/101301/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/pull/101301&quot;&gt;#101301&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turbopack: use hash collections for turbo-tasks values whose order is unobserved: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6113577662&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/100939&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vercel/next.js/pull/100939/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/pull/100939&quot;&gt;#100939&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turbopack: don&#39;t split page entries into a facade: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6205884653&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/101152&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vercel/next.js/pull/101152/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/pull/101152&quot;&gt;#101152&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turbopack: replace Next.js entry kinds with an opaque entry tag: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6247518774&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/101291&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vercel/next.js/pull/101291/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/pull/101291&quot;&gt;#101291&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;docs: map BFF proxy example routes to fixed backend endpoints: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6246685703&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/101286&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vercel/next.js/pull/101286/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/pull/101286&quot;&gt;#101286&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
